OL,3,GNEWSAMan whose gun jammed during teen
OL,4,Ashooting is jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who tried to kill a teenager
OL,7,Fbefore his gun jammed twice has been
OL,8,Fjailed for at least 22 years.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Police was called to
OL,11,Freports that a 17-year-old boy was
OL,12,Fseriously injured in Hazel Wood in
OL,13,FCorby, just after 16:30 BST on 11 April
OL,14,F2025.
OL,16,FDrug dealer Matas Sukaitis, 22, had
OL,17,Fshot him once in the back and had
OL,18,Fattempted to shoot him in the head when
OL,19,Fthe gun jammed. He went on to stab the
OL,20,Fboy twice in the leg and kicked him in
OL,21,Fthe face during what the force called
OL,22,Fan "assassination attempt".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
