OL,3,GNEWSAMan whose gun jammed during teen
OL,4,Ashooting is jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday at Northampton Crown Court,
OL,7,FSukaitis, of Chaucer Close in the town,
OL,8,Fwas given a life sentence for attempted
OL,9,Fmurder.
